      {
        "id": "s_risky",
        "name": "02 | Reference - verified lab exchange",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. Clinical content is Customer Content; clinician/patient references are EUPI, not anonymous. Repository content follows a separately approved clinical schedule (over48hours does not prescribe a legal period). The partner receives no full chart and deletes exchange copies after an illustrative 30 days under contract. Clinical obligations may require other records outside this diagram. All subject processes and stores are in scope; external participants are visible black boxes, not excluded infrastructure. Numbering orders requests; response buckets return on the same call, not a second login. The initial clinician call returns the current summary and accepted order reference, not the later asynchronous lab result. The callback is checked against the SQL assignment stored before dispatch; a later result-view request is not modeled.",
